        "zh": "OpenCut 是一个开源视频编辑器，旨在成为 CapCut 的免费替代品，让用户摆脱专有软件的限制。它使用 TypeScript 构建，模块化架构支持跨平台部署，并通过节点式合成系统实现图层和特效的精细控制。此外，其插件机制允许社区贡献功能，实时预览加速编辑流程。你可以用它进行视频剪辑、添加字幕、滤镜和转场，开发者可轻松扩展或集成。适用于视频创作、社交媒体内容制作以及教育用途。",
        "es": "OpenCut is an open-source video editor serving as a free alternative to CapCut, enabling anyone to edit videos without proprietary restrictions. Its modular, TypeScript-based architecture ensures cross-platform compatibility and extensibility, while the node-based composition system provides granular control over effects and layers. Typical use cases include video production, social media content creation, and custom editing pipelines. Developers can extend or embed it easily.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "OpenCut stands out for editor, oss, and videoeditor in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "OpenCut is an open-source video editor serving as a free alternative to CapCut, enabling anyone to edit videos without proprietary restrictions. Its modular, TypeScript-based architecture ensures cross-platform compatibility and extensibility, while the node-based composition system provides granular control over effects and layers. Typical use cases include video production, social media content creation, and custom editing pipelines. Developers can extend or embed it easily.",
