        "en": "grok2api is a multi-account API gateway for Grok services (Build, Web, Console), unifying access and managing credentials. Built in Go, it offers high performance, load balancing, and automatic failover across accounts for reliability. You can deploy it as a reverse proxy to route requests, simplify authentication, and scale usage without exposing individual API keys—ideal for integrating Grok into applications or teams.",
        "zh": "grok2api 是一个专为 Grok Build、Grok Web 与 Grok Console 设计的多账号 API 网关，核心目标是统一管理多个 Grok 账号的访问入口，解决多账号轮询、负载均衡和密钥管理问题。它采用 Go 语言开发，具备高性能与低延迟特点，支持自动故障切换，确保高可用性。典型用法是部署为反向代理层，透明转发请求，开发者无需关心底层账号细节即可安全调用 Grok 服务。适合需要将 Grok 能力集成到自有应用、进行批量调用或团队共享使用的场景，部署简单，可快速提升 API 调用的稳定性和扩展性。",
        "es": "grok2api is a multi-account API gateway for Grok services (Build, Web, Console), unifying access and managing credentials. Built in Go, it offers high performance, load balancing, and automatic failover across accounts for reliability. You can deploy it as a reverse proxy to route requests, simplify authentication, and scale usage without exposing individual API keys—ideal for integrating Grok into applications or teams.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "grok2api stands out for grok and grok-imagine in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "grok2api is a multi-account API gateway for Grok services (Build, Web, Console), unifying access and managing credentials. Built in Go, it offers high performance, load balancing, and automatic failover across accounts for reliability. You can deploy it as a reverse proxy to route requests, simplify authentication, and scale usage without exposing individual API keys—ideal for integrating Grok into applications or teams.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/chenyme/grok2api for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
