        "zh": "Clypra 是一款基于 Tauri、React 和 TypeScript 构建的现代视频编辑器，旨在免费替代 CapCut 等软件的付费功能。其核心优势在于 Tauri 提供轻量级桌面运行时，结合 React 组件化 UI，实现接近原生的性能并降低 Web 开发者上手门槛。支持视频剪辑、特效添加，模块化设计可扩展自定义过渡或插件。适合视频创作者和前端开发者，兼具实用工具与学习样本价值。",
        "es": "Clypra is a modern video editor built with Tauri, React, and TypeScript, aiming to provide free alternatives to premium CapCut features. Its key technical strength lies in combining Tauri's lightweight desktop runtime with React's component-based UI, enabling near-native performance with familiar web development workflows. You can use it for full-featured video editing or extend its capabilities through its modular design. Try building custom transitions or effects using its plugin-friendly architecture.",
