        "es": "Qwen3-Coder-Next-FP8 is a code-focused large language model optimized for efficient deployment via FP8 quantization, reducing memory and latency while maintaining high code generation quality. Its key innovation is post-training quantization to 8-bit floating point, enabling deployment on resource-constrained hardware without significant accuracy loss. Use it as a local coding assistant, integrate into IDEs for autocomplete, or build conversational agents that write and debug code.",
